==English==

===Etymology===
From {{der|en|la|recrūdēscō|t=I become raw again}}; from {{m|la|re-}} + {{m|la|crūdēscō|t=I become harsh or raw}}.

===Noun===
{{wikipedia}}
{{en-noun|~}}

# The state or condition of being [[recrudescent]].
#: ''A '''recrudescence''' of barbarism may condemn it [land] to chronic poverty and waste.'' &mdash; Duke of Argyll.
# {{lb|en|medicine}} the [[acute]] [[recurrence]] of a [[disease]], or its [[symptom]]s, after a period of [[improvement]]

